.Dd November 18, 2026
.Dt NEWFS 8
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm newfs
.Nd construct a UFS1/UFS2 filesystem on a block device
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl O Ar 1|2
.Op Fl b Ar block-size
.Op Fl f Ar fragment-size
.Op Fl s Ar size
.Op Fl L Ar label
.Op Ar block:0
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility formats a block device through the
.Dq block:
scheme using the pure-Rust UFS formatter.
The default is UFS2 with 4096-byte blocks and 512-byte fragments.
The
.Fl O
option selects UFS1 or UFS2.
The optional
.Fl s
size accepts k/m/g suffixes and must be a multiple of the block size.
An open or format failure is reported and exits non-zero.
No format result is fabricated.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
Returns 0 on success.
Returns 1 on an open or format error.
Returns 2 on usage errors.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr lsblk 1 ,
.Xr gpart 8
